# PAI Universe
People, Agents, Intelligent — Build Your Economy.

## Organization
PAI Universe is a single ecosystem. AxiomID is the entry point.
All services are subdomains of axiomid.app.
All repos live under github.com/pai-list.

## Core Principles
1. SOUL Protocol: Muraqabah, Tawbah, TrustChain
2. One ecosystem, not separate projects
3. AxiomID is always the front door
4. Subdomain everything: agent. gspace. discover. memory. mcp. verify. dev.

## Architecture
Entry → AxiomID (identity, trust, API gateway)
Layer 1 → Pi Network (human verification, KYC)
Layer 2 → Ghost.build (pgvector, warm memory)  
Layer 3 → ADP (agent discovery)
Layer 4 → PAI-Memory (7-layer memory)
Layer 5 → pai-mcp (MCP gateway)
Layer 6 → Gspace (global workspace)
Layer 7 → Virtuals ACP (commerce)

## Key Files to Read
- /docs/introduction.md - Start here
- /agents.txt - Complete ecosystem overview
- /CONTRIBUTING.md - Contribution guidelines
- /SOUL.md - Protocol specification

## Common Tasks
- Create identity: docs/identity-guide.md
- Deploy agent: docs/deployment-guide.md
- Build memory: docs/memory-architecture.md
- Contribute: https://github.com/pai-list/.github/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md

## Connectivity
- HTTP: axiomid.app (Vercel + Cloudflare)
- MCP: mcp.axiomid.app (Cloudflare Workers)
- Database: Ghost.build (Postgres + pgvector)
- Identity: AxiomID + Pi KYC
- Commerce: Virtuals ACP
